    <statement><p>Write the following percentages as decimals.</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 462\% = }</m> <fillin characters="7" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 46.2\% = }</m> <fillin characters="7" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 4.62\% = }</m> <fillin characters="7" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
