    <solution><p>To change a percentage to a decimal, we move the decimal to the left twice.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 462\% = {4.62} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 46.2\% = {0.462} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 4.62\% = {0.0462} }</m></p>
</solution>
